  "releaseNotes": "Use nested plugin maps and add lookups:\n      - Replace the flat Utf8Map<List<Type>> plugin cache with a nested Utf8Map<Utf8Map<Type>> keyed by plugin type then plugin name.\n      - ScanInternal now builds inner name->Type maps, freezes them for read performance, and iterates over pairs when auto-registering contracts.\n      - Public APIs were updated: GetPlugins now returns Utf8Map<Type>, and new GetPlugin overloads allow lookup by plugin name or by service/interface type; Lucifer.cs was updated to expose these new methods.\n      - This enables direct, efficient plugin retrieval by name or contract and simplifies registration/lookup logic.",
